return {
    ["       梅丽莎深深看了他一眼，忽地转身，小跑步进了里间，拿出一个由齿轮、锈铁、弹簧和发条等拼凑成的乌龟状物品。\n快速扭紧发条，梅丽莎将这物品放在了书桌上。\n       咔咔咔，哒哒哒，那“乌龟”一跳一走，很有节律，让人不由自主就将注意力转移到了它身上。\n       “感觉烦恼的时候，看着它这么动一动，会舒服很多，我最近经常这样，很有效的！克莱恩，你试一试。”梅丽莎眸光明亮地邀请道。\n       克莱恩没拒绝妹妹的好意，凑近看着那“乌龟”，等到它停止才笑道：\n       “简单和规律确实能带来放松。”\n       不等梅丽莎再说，他指着“乌龟”，随口问道：\n       “自己做的？什么时候做的？我怎么不知道？”\n       “我用学校不要的材料和路上捡到的东西做的，前两天才弄好。”梅丽莎表情如常，嘴角翘了几分。\n       “很厉害啊。”克莱恩由衷赞道。\n       作为一名在机械方面动手能力差的男孩子，他小时候拼个四驱车都要死要活。\n       梅丽莎下巴微抬，眼睛略弯，语气平淡地回答：\n       “还好，还好。”\n       “过分的谦虚是坏品格。”克莱恩轻笑道，“这是只乌龟吧？”\n       房间内的气氛突然沉凝了一下，梅丽莎的嗓音幽幽如同绯红轻纱般响起：\n       “它是人偶。”\n\n       ——第一卷《小丑》第十六章 狗拿耗子"] = "Melissa looked at him deeply, suddenly turned around, trotted into the inner room, and took out a turtle-shaped object pieced together from gears, rusty iron, springs, and clockwork. \n Quickly tightening the clockwork, Melissa placed the object on the desk. \n Click, click, click, da, da, da, the “turtle” jumped and walked, very rhythmic, making people involuntarily shift their attention to it. \n “When you feel troubled, watching it move like this will make you feel much better. I’ve been doing this a lot lately, it’s very effective! Klein, you try it.” Melissa invited with bright eyes. \n Klein didn’t refuse his sister’s kindness, leaned close to watch the “turtle,” and didn’t smile until it stopped: \n “Simplicity and regularity can indeed bring relaxation.” \n Without waiting for Melissa to say more, he pointed to the “turtle” and asked casually: \n “Did you make it yourself? When did you make it? Why didn’t I know?” \n “I made it with materials the school didn’t want and things I picked up on the road. I just finished it two days ago.” Melissa’s expression was as usual, the corners of her mouth raised a little. \n “That’s amazing.” Klein praised sincerely. \n As a boy with poor hands-on ability in mechanics, he struggled to assemble a four-wheel drive car when he was a child. \n Melissa raised her chin slightly, her eyes curved slightly, and she replied in a flat tone: \n “It’s okay, it’s okay.” \n “Excessive modesty is a bad character.” Klein chuckled, “This is a turtle, right?” \n The atmosphere in the room suddenly condensed, and Melissa’s voice sounded like crimson gauze: \n “It’s a doll.” \n \n —— Volume 1: Clown, Chapter 16: A Dog Catching a Mouse",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>就你叫戈多啊</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>剧情-时代百态\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>完成时代逸闻《等待戈多》"] = "<Assistant_Title1> So You Are the One Called Godot </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Achievement Category: </> Plot - Era Life \n<Assistant_Title2> Unlock Condition: </> Complete the Era Anecdote \"Waiting for Godot\"",
    ["<Highlight>【死亡永渡】</>为限时结交人脉活动。\n活动期间，<Highlight>阿兹克·艾格斯</>结交概率大幅提升。当获得传说人脉时，80%概率为阿兹克·艾格斯。如果本次结交的传说人脉不是阿兹克·艾格斯，则下次结交获得传说人脉时必定为阿兹克·艾格斯。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>概率信息</>\n<Highlight>[传说]</>品质人脉：基础概率为1.5%，综合概率（含保底）为3.74%\n包含：阿兹克·艾格斯、克莱恩·莫雷蒂、奥黛丽·霍尔、伦纳德·米切尔、佛尔思·沃尔、邓恩·史密斯、戴莉·西蒙妮、阿尔杰·威尔逊\n\n<Highlight>[史诗]</>品质人脉：基础概率为10%，综合概率（含保底）为22.56%\n包含：苏茜、洛薇雅·蒂芙尼、老尼尔、弗莱、弗兰克·李、班森·莫雷蒂、梅丽莎·莫雷蒂\n\n<Highlight>[常规道具]相关</>：基础概率为88.5%，综合概率（含保底）为73.70%\n包含：基础物质、聚合因子\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>结交细则</>\n1、每5次结交，必定获得一位史诗或以上的人脉。\n\n2、如果连续24次结交未获得传说人脉，则后续概率逐渐提升。\n每40次结交必定获得传说人脉。\n获得传说人脉后计数重置，概率恢复为基础概率。\n\n3、【死亡永渡】的保底次数会一直累积在限时结交活动中，与常驻结交活动独立计算互不影响。\n\n4、限时结交活动每日可获得100次结交次数，最多可累计至700次。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>重复获得人脉</>\n重复获得相同传说人脉时，将转化为1个对应人脉提升材料和10个投影片段。如果该传说人脉已经达到极致或材料足以提升至极致，多余的提升材料会转化为40个投影片段。\n重复获得相同史诗人脉时，将转化为1个对应人脉提升材料和2个投影片段。如果该史诗人脉已经达到极致或材料足以提升至极致，多余的提升材料会转化为2个投影片段。\n投影片段可用于在人脉商店兑换道具。"] = "<Highlight> [Death's Eternal Crossing] </> is a limited-time Befriending Connections activity. \n During the activity, the Befriending probability of <Highlight> Azik Eggers </> is greatly increased. When you obtain a Legendary Connection, there is an 80% probability that it is Azik Eggers. If the Legendary Connection obtained this time is not Azik Eggers, the next Legendary Connection obtained is guaranteed to be Azik Eggers. \n \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Probability Information </> \n <Highlight> [Legendary] </> Quality Connection: Base probability is 1.5%, comprehensive probability (including pity) is 3.74%. \n Includes: Azik Eggers, Klein Moretti, Audrey Hall, Leonard Mitchell, Fors Wall, Dunn Smith, Daly Simone, Alger Wilson. \n \n <Highlight> [Epic] </> Quality Connection: Base probability is 10%, comprehensive probability (including pity) is 22.56%. \n Includes: Susie, Lovia Tiffany, Old Neil, Frye, Frank Lee, Benson Moretti, Melissa Moretti. \n \n <Highlight> [General Items] Related </>: Base probability is 88.5%, comprehensive probability (including pity) is 73.70%. \n Includes: Basic Materials, Aggregation Factors. \n \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Befriending Details </> \n 1. Every 5 Befriending attempts, you are guaranteed to obtain a Connection of Epic quality or higher. \n \n 2. If you do not obtain a Legendary Connection in 24 consecutive Befriending attempts, the subsequent probability will gradually increase. \n You are guaranteed to obtain a Legendary Connection every 40 Befriending attempts. \n After obtaining a Legendary Connection, the count resets, and the probability returns to the base probability. \n \n 3. The pity count for [Death's Eternal Crossing] will always accumulate in the limited-time Befriending activity and is calculated independently of the permanent Befriending activity, not affecting each other. \n \n 4. In the limited-time Befriending activity, you can obtain 100 Befriending attempts per day, which can be accumulated up to 700 times. \n \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Repeatedly Obtaining Connections </> \n When you repeatedly obtain the same Legendary Connection, it will be converted into 1 corresponding Connection improvement material and 10 Projection Fragments. If that Legendary Connection has already reached the ultimate level or the materials are sufficient to upgrade it to the ultimate level, the excess improvement materials will be converted into 40 Projection Fragments. \n When you repeatedly obtain the same Epic Connection, it will be converted into 1 corresponding Connection improvement material and 2 Projection Fragments. If that Epic Connection has already reached the ultimate level or the materials are sufficient to upgrade it to the ultimate level, the excess improvement materials will be converted into 2 Projection Fragments. \n Projection Fragments can be used to exchange for items in the Connection Shop.",
