    ["（四）\n　　在山上找到了一颗琥珀，把佐治羡慕坏了。这是我在霍纳奇斯登山以来最特殊的一个登顶纪念品。\n　　奇怪的是，这颗琥珀是从什么时候到我手里的？我为什么会不记得？\n　　琥珀里还有一只小虫子，听说琥珀里面的虫子是跨越了千万年时间的“时间旅客”？千万年前的虫子长这样？"] = "(IV) \n　　Found an amber on the mountain, which made George very envious. This is the most special souvenir I've had since I started mountaineering in Hornacis. \n　　The strange thing is, when did this amber come into my hands? Why don't I remember? \n　　There is a small bug inside the amber. I heard that bugs in amber are \"time travelers\" that have crossed millions of years? Do bugs from millions of years ago look like this?",
